WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:06.730
Hi! Today, let's compare things: animals, places and food!

2
00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:11.570
Look at the elephant. And look at the mouse!

3
00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:14.992
The elephant is bigger than the mouse.

4
00:00:17.242 --> 00:00:20.214
The cheetah is faster than the turtle.

5
00:00:20.664 --> 00:00:27.027
The turtle is slower… but it's older! Turtles live for a long time.

6
00:00:29.277 --> 00:00:35.082
In winter, Canada is very cold. Canada is colder than Brazil.

7
00:00:35.532 --> 00:00:40.640
And Rio de Janeiro is hotter than Toronto, of course!

8
00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:45.723
A car is more expensive than a bike.

9
00:00:46.173 --> 00:00:49.610
A bike is cheaper, and it's healthier, too!

10
00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:54.692
Salad is healthier than pizza…

11
00:00:55.142 --> 00:00:58.579
…but pizza is more delicious than salad!

12
00:01:00.829 --> 00:01:05.101
And you? Who is taller, you or your best friend?

